+        ". Your proxy appears to only use HTTP and not HTTPS, "
+        "try changing your proxy URL to be HTTP. See: "
+        "https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/advanced-usage.html"
+        "#https-proxy-error-http-proxy"
+    )
